Run: --iommu intel --entry 68 600 -smp 4
Expect: modload_test: \[3\] modload_load_class\("modload_b"\) gave 3 module\(s\): .* -- WRONG

diff --git a/uros/src/lib/libmodload/modload.c b/uros/src/lib/libmodload/modload.c
index 1f4b35ed..29bb6cb8 100644
--- a/uros/src/lib/libmodload/modload.c
+++ b/uros/src/lib/libmodload/modload.c
@@ -383,8 +383,7 @@ modload_load_class(const char *class, const char *sym_suffix,
